{
  "name": "GetSales: post each reply to Slack with its text",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "triggerOn": "replyReceived"
      },
      "name": "Reply received",
      "type": "@getsales/n8n-nodes-getsales.getSalesTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "get",
        "messageSid": "={{ $json.payload.sid }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Read the reply",
      "type": "@getsales/n8n-nodes-getsales.getSales",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        240,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "post",
        "select": "channel",
        "channelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": ""
        },
        "text": "=New reply on {{ $json.message.channel }}:\n{{ $json.message.body_text }}",
        "otherOptions": {}
      },
      "name": "Post to Slack",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 2.7,
      "position": [
        480,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Post each reply to Slack\n\n1. Create a **GetSales API** credential with a key from GetSales, Settings, API keys (the Automation platform preset).\n2. Pick a Slack credential and the channel in **Post to Slack**.\n3. Activate the workflow. The trigger subscribes its URL in GetSales, so n8n needs a public https address.\n\nThe trigger carries the message's sid, never its text: **Read the reply** fetches the text.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 420
      },
      "name": "Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        -340
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Reply received": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Read the reply",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Read the reply": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Post to Slack",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  }
}
